OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality disappointed at Fort
OL,4,ARegent delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FHospitality leaders have criticised the
OL,7,Fdecision to pause the redevelopment of
OL,8,Fa leisure centre, saying it is "deeply
OL,9,Fdisappointed, though sadly not
OL,10,Fsurprised" by the move.
OL,12,FThe Government of Jersey announced this
OL,13,Fweek that it would explore private
OL,14,Finvestment in the Fort Regent leisure
OL,15,Fcentre project after costs increased
OL,16,Fbeyond the #110m estimate published two
OL,17,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
