OL,3,GNEWSAHospitality disappointed at Fort
OL,4,ARegent delay
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinisters are expected to consider the
OL,7,Ffuture of the scheme in 2027 while
OL,8,Fofficials assess the cost of essential
OL,9,Fwork and gauge commercial interest in
OL,10,Fthe site.
OL,12,FThe Jersey Hospitality Association
OL,13,F(JHA) claimed "the vision presented to
OL,14,Fislanders last year was never matched
OL,15,Fby a budget that could deliver it".
